<title>USA: General Growth completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>General Growth completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Growth Properties Inc said Tuesday it has completed the acquisition of General Growth Management Inc, its separate management operation, for about $51.5 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition involves an exchange of General Growth Properties common stock and limited partnership interests in its affiliate, GGP Limited Partnership, the company said.</p>
<p>General Growth owns and manages shopping malls.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
